  "why": "A gas stove in a kitchen, cut open: a gas pipe, a knob and a nozzle grow into a Bunsen burner tube with air holes, a burner head and a thermocouple safety valve. The camera stays on the stove; the name line frames the whole burner and traces it.",
  "story": {
   "title": "How a gas stove works",
   "hero": "a Bunsen burner",
   "parts": [
    "gas pipe",
    "knob",
    "burner tube",
    "air holes",
    "burner head",
    "thermocouple",
